# choose — player choice, nested choices, arbitrary code in arms

"Choose" by Test

class Topic
Topic Jason
Topic Help
Topic Farewell

class Opinion
Opinion Exasperating
Opinion Beloved

var topic
var opinion

Object Medea "A woman of fierce intelligence."

on talk to Medea:
    say "we are talking"
    choose "What do you want to talk about?":
        "Tell me about Jason.":
            topic = Jason
            choose:
                "Exasperating.":
                    opinion = Exasperating
                    say "She grimaces."
                "The man I love.":
                    opinion = Beloved
                    say "Her eyes soften."
        "I need your help.":
            topic = Help
            say "Medea considers your request."
        "Farewell.":
            topic = Farewell
            say "She nods curtly."

Room home

test
    test "top-level choice".
    test "nested choice".
    test "farewell".

test "top-level choice"
    talk to Medea. "What do you want to talk about"

test "nested choice"
    talk to Medea.
    choose "Tell me about Jason.".
    choose "Exasperating.". "grimaces"

test "farewell"
    talk to Medea.
    choose "Farewell.". "nods curtly"
